        "rule": "The business's portfolio priority is determined by the following priority:\n1. “High”, if the classified loan flag is set;\n2. “Medium”, if at least one of the following holds: the meets CDD rule flag is not set; the prospect flag is set; or the count of loans is 0;\n3. in all other cases, “Low”.",
